  "note": "NOT RUN (built 2026-10-30). docs/204 Compaction correctness queue (no timing: noiseCheck false; run with --no-smoke): opt-in, offered (accept, decline), refused (build mode), failure (test switch), main-menu route on BP and IP, plus the save matrix with the hooks installed but never firing. Needs ts3native 0.36.128 parked as game-copy/ts3native.asi.compact1 and the ts3fixes/ts3agent build of this branch (cycle.ts installs build/ts3fixes.package). ThresholdMB=4000 forces the verdict (largest free is always under 4 GB); MinMinutes=0 skips the 60-min rule. Read per job: ts3native.log \"compaction:\" lines, the repro log (compaction_* counters before / after), and the save matrix md for the matrix jobs. ~15 min per repro job, ~60-120 min per matrix job.",
  "jobs": [
    {
      "id": "bp-compaction-optin",
      "note": "Opt-in path: save under the (forced) threshold -> direct reload -> restore; then a Save over the compacted file that must not compact again. Pass: exit 0, every listed log line, both saves result 1, no failure line, no crash; compaction_requeued + compaction_requeue_skipped + compaction_requeue_fail = compaction_recorded (every recorded entry tried).",
      "asi": "game-copy/ts3native.asi.compact1",
      "save": "Baseline-BP-Spring",
      "releaseDefaults": true,
      "noiseCheck": false,
      "callSites": false,
      "ini": {
        "UserDiag.Enabled": 1,
        "SaveWrite.Enabled": 1,
        "Compaction.Enabled": 1,
        "Compaction.ThresholdMB": 4000,
        "Compaction.MinMinutes": 0
      },
      "logRequire": {
        "^compaction: on ": 1,
        "^compaction: verdict COMPACT ": 1,
        "^compaction: begin #1 ": 1,
        "^compaction: done #1 ": 1,
        "^ts3fixes: compaction: restored ": 1,
        "^save: end #\\d+ result 1 ": 2,
        "^compaction: verdict no ": 1
